OL,3,GNEWSA'A tumour the size of a football
OL,4,Asaved my life'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum-of-three who was diagnosed with a
OL,7,Frare cancer has urged other women not
OL,8,Fto dismiss their symptoms.
OL,10,FWhen Lisa Carroll, 47, from Coventry,
OL,11,Freturned from a family holiday in
OL,12,FAugust 2021, she thought she was
OL,13,Fsuffering from irritable bowel syndrome
OL,14,F(IBS), a kidney infection or something
OL,15,Fminor.
OL,17,FInstead, she was told it was mucinous
OL,18,Fovarian cancer (MOC), one of the rarest
OL,19,Fforms of ovarian cancer in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
